OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of seven counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof the attempted murder of seven people
OL,9,Fhe stabbed on a Peterborough-London
OL,10,Ftrain in 2025
OL,12,FWilliams, 33, attacked 10 people in
OL,13,Ftotal on the LNER service on 1 November
OL,14,Flast year
OL,16,FHe denied 14 counts of attempted
OL,17,Fmurder, which includes alleged attacks
OL,18,Faway from the train, in Peterborough
OL,19,Fand London
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
