OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of seven counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury has yet to reach verdicts on
OL,8,Fthe other seven counts of attempted
OL,9,Fmurder, and the judge has asked them to
OL,10,Fcontinue deliberations
OL,12,FMr Justice Calver says he will accept a
OL,13,Fmajority, of 11 or 10 of the 12 jurors,
OL,14,Fon the remaining counts
